{"seq":2,"slug":"resource-quota-fairness","title":"资源配额与公平性保障","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/platform-engineering/resource-quota-fairness","wordCount":1304,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"资源配额与公平性保障\">资源配额与公平性保障</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Noisy Neighbor（吵闹邻居）</strong>：一个租户的异常资源消耗影响其他共享租户体验的问题</li>\n<li><strong>速率限制（Rate Limiting）</strong>：控制租户请求频率的机制，防止资源耗尽</li>\n<li><strong>令牌桶（Token Bucket）</strong>：允许突发同时控制平均速率的流量控制算法</li>\n<li><strong>加权公平队列（WFQ）</strong>：按租户权重分配共享资源处理能力的调度策略</li>\n<li><strong>计量（Metering）</strong>：精确记录每个租户的资源消耗量，用于配额检查和计费</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"吵闹邻居问题的本质\">吵闹邻居问题的本质</h2><p>在多租户共享基础设施中，一个租户的异常行为（大查询、流量尖峰、数据爬取）会消耗过多共享资源，导致其他租户的服务质量退化——这就是「Noisy Neighbor」问题。它是 Pool 和 Bridge 模式面临的核心运营挑战。</p>\n<p>2026 年的实证数据表明：B2B SaaS 的使用量分布遵循幂律——最大的 1% 租户消耗超过 50% 的总资源。如果不设置配额和公平性机制，这些超级租户将系统性地降低其他 99% 租户的体验。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 无配额保护&#10;        T_BIG[大租户&lt;br/&gt;占用 80% CPU] --&gt; SHARED[共享资源池]&#10;        T_SMALL1[小租户 A] --&gt; SHARED&#10;        T_SMALL2[小租户 B] --&gt; SHARED&#10;        SHARED --&gt; DEGRADE[小租户延迟飙升&lt;br/&gt;体验退化]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph 有配额保护&#10;        T_BIG2[大租户&lt;br/&gt;受配额限制] --&gt; QUOTA{配额网关}&#10;        T_SMALL3[小租户 A] --&gt; QUOTA&#10;        T_SMALL4[小租户 B] --&gt; QUOTA&#10;        QUOTA --&gt;|公平调度| SHARED2[共享资源池]&#10;        SHARED2 --&gt; FAIR[所有租户&lt;br/&gt;SLA 得到保障]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 无配额保护\n        T_BIG[大租户&lt;br/&gt;占用 80% CPU] --&gt; SHARED[共享资源池]\n        T_SMALL1[小租户 A] --&gt; SHARED\n        T_SMALL2[小租户 B] --&gt; SHARED\n        SHARED --&gt; DEGRADE[小租户延迟飙升&lt;br/&gt;体验退化]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 有配额保护\n        T_BIG2[大租户&lt;br/&gt;受配额限制] --&gt; QUOTA{配额网关}\n        T_SMALL3[小租户 A] --&gt; QUOTA\n        T_SMALL4[小租户 B] --&gt; QUOTA\n        QUOTA --&gt;|公平调度| SHARED2[共享资源池]\n        SHARED2 --&gt; FAIR[所有租户&lt;br/&gt;SLA 得到保障]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"配额模型设计\">配额模型设计</h2><h3 id=\"多维度配额体系\">多维度配额体系</h3><p>资源配额不是单一阈值，而是一组覆盖不同资源维度的限制：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配额维度</th>\n<th>单位</th>\n<th>典型阈值（标准版）</th>\n<th>典型阈值（企业版）</th>\n<th>超限行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>API 请求速率</td>\n<td>req/min</td>\n<td>1,000</td>\n<td>50,000</td>\n<td>返回 429</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并发连接数</td>\n<td>连接</td>\n<td>50</td>\n<td>500</td>\n<td>排队等待</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据库查询时长</td>\n<td>秒/查询</td>\n<td>30s</td>\n<td>120s</td>\n<td>强制 CANCEL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储容量</td>\n<td>GB</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>1,000</td>\n<td>拒绝写入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>带宽</td>\n<td>MB/min</td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>10,000</td>\n<td>限速</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后台任务数</td>\n<td>并发数</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>排队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Webhook 调用</td>\n<td>次/小时</td>\n<td>1,000</td>\n<td>100,000</td>\n<td>丢弃 + 告警</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"配额继承与覆盖\">配额继承与覆盖</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    DEFAULT[平台默认配额] --&gt; PLAN[套餐级配额&lt;br/&gt;Starter/Business/Enterprise]&#10;    PLAN --&gt; TENANT[租户级覆盖&lt;br/&gt;针对特定大客户]&#10;    TENANT --&gt; OVERRIDE[临时覆盖&lt;br/&gt;促销期/迁移期]&#10;&#10;    DEFAULT --&gt;|最低优先级| EVAL[配额评估引擎]&#10;    PLAN --&gt;|中优先级| EVAL&#10;    TENANT --&gt;|高优先级| EVAL&#10;    OVERRIDE --&gt;|最高优先级| EVAL&#10;&#10;    EVAL --&gt; EFFECTIVE[生效配额]\">graph TD\n    DEFAULT[平台默认配额] --&gt; PLAN[套餐级配额&lt;br/&gt;Starter/Business/Enterprise]\n    PLAN --&gt; TENANT[租户级覆盖&lt;br/&gt;针对特定大客户]\n    TENANT --&gt; OVERRIDE[临时覆盖&lt;br/&gt;促销期/迁移期]\n\n    DEFAULT --&gt;|最低优先级| EVAL[配额评估引擎]\n    PLAN --&gt;|中优先级| EVAL\n    TENANT --&gt;|高优先级| EVAL\n    OVERRIDE --&gt;|最高优先级| EVAL\n\n    EVAL --&gt; EFFECTIVE[生效配额]</pre><p>配额配置的数据模型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface QuotaProfile {&#10;  profileId: string;&#10;  name: string; // e.g., &quot;business_standard&quot;&#10;&#10;  limits: {&#10;    apiRatePerMinute: number;&#10;    maxConcurrentConnections: number;&#10;    queryTimeoutSeconds: number;&#10;    storageBytes: number;&#10;    bandwidthBytesPerMinute: number;&#10;    backgroundJobsConcurrent: number;&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  // 突发容忍：短期超限不立即拒绝&#10;  burst: {&#10;    enabled: boolean;&#10;    multiplier: number; // 允许突发到正常值的 N 倍&#10;    windowSeconds: number; // 突发窗口时长&#10;    cooldownSeconds: number; // 突发后冷却时间&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  // 超限策略&#10;  overLimitPolicy: &#39;reject&#39; | &#39;queue&#39; | &#39;degrade&#39; | &#39;notify_only&#39;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> QuotaProfile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  profileId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// e.g., \"business_standard\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  limits</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    apiRatePerMinute</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    maxConcurrentConnections</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    queryTimeoutSeconds</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    storageBytes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    bandwidthBytesPerMinute</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    backgroundJobsConcurrent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 突发容忍：短期超限不立即拒绝</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  burst</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    enabled</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    multiplier</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 允许突发到正常值的 N 倍</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    windowSeconds</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 突发窗口时长</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    cooldownSeconds</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 突发后冷却时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 超限策略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  overLimitPolicy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'reject'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'queue'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'degrade'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'notify_only'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"速率限制实现\">速率限制实现</h2><h3 id=\"令牌桶-滑动窗口混合方案\">令牌桶 + 滑动窗口混合方案</h3><p>单一算法无法满足所有场景。生产系统通常混合使用：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固定窗口</td>\n<td>实现最简</td>\n<td>窗口边界处流量翻倍</td>\n<td>粗粒度统计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滑动窗口</td>\n<td>平滑无边界效应</td>\n<td>内存占用高</td>\n<td>API 速率限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>令牌桶</td>\n<td>允许突发 + 平均速率控制</td>\n<td>参数调优复杂</td>\n<td>带宽/吞吐控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>漏桶</td>\n<td>严格匀速输出</td>\n<td>不允许任何突发</td>\n<td>后台任务调度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Redis 实现的滑动窗口速率限制&#10;class SlidingWindowRateLimiter {&#10;  private redis: Redis;&#10;&#10;  async isAllowed(tenantId: string, limit: number, windowSec: number): Promise&lt;boolean&gt; {&#10;    const key = `ratelimit:${tenantId}`;&#10;    const now = Date.now();&#10;    const windowStart = now - windowSec * 1000;&#10;&#10;    const pipeline = this.redis.pipeline();&#10;    // 清除窗口外的记录&#10;    pipeline.zremrangebyscore(key, 0, windowStart);&#10;    // 统计窗口内的请求数&#10;    pipeline.zcard(key);&#10;    // 添加当前请求&#10;    pipeline.zadd(key, now, `${now}:${Math.random()}`);&#10;    // 设置键过期时间&#10;    pipeline.expire(key, windowSec);&#10;&#10;    const results = await pipeline.exec();&#10;    const currentCount = results[1][1] as number;&#10;&#10;    if (currentCount &gt;= limit) {&#10;      // 移除刚添加的记录（请求被拒绝）&#10;      await this.redis.zremrangebyscore(key, now, now);&#10;      return false;&#10;    }&#10;    return true;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Redis 实现的滑动窗口速率限制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SlidingWindowRateLimiter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> redis</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Redis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  async</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isAllowed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tenantId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">limit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">windowSec</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `ratelimit:${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tenantId</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Date.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> windowStart</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> now </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> windowSec </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pipeline</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.redis.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pipeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 清除窗口外的记录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pipeline.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">zremrangebyscore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, windowStart);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 统计窗口内的请求数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pipeline.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">zcard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 添加当前请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pipeline.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">zadd</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, now, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">now</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}:${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Math</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">random</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">()</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 设置键过期时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pipeline.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">expire</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, windowSec);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> results</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pipeline.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> currentCount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (currentCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> limit) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 移除刚添加的记录（请求被拒绝）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.redis.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">zremrangebyscore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, now, now);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"分布式速率限制的一致性\">分布式速率限制的一致性</h3><p>在多实例部署中，速率限制状态必须集中存储（通常是 Redis）。但网络延迟和并发竞争会导致精度损失：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant App1 as 应用实例 1&#10;    participant App2 as 应用实例 2&#10;    participant Redis as Redis(限流状态)&#10;&#10;    App1-&gt;&gt;Redis: INCR tenant_a_count (当前 99)&#10;    App2-&gt;&gt;Redis: INCR tenant_a_count (当前 100)&#10;    Note over Redis: 限制 = 100&#10;    Redis--&gt;&gt;App1: 100 (刚好到限)&#10;    Redis--&gt;&gt;App2: 101 (轻微超限)&#10;    Note over App2: 竞态条件:少量超限是可接受的\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant App1 as 应用实例 1\n    participant App2 as 应用实例 2\n    participant Redis as Redis(限流状态)\n\n    App1-&gt;&gt;Redis: INCR tenant_a_count (当前 99)\n    App2-&gt;&gt;Redis: INCR tenant_a_count (当前 100)\n    Note over Redis: 限制 = 100\n    Redis--&gt;&gt;App1: 100 (刚好到限)\n    Redis--&gt;&gt;App2: 101 (轻微超限)\n    Note over App2: 竞态条件:少量超限是可接受的</pre><p><strong>实践建议</strong>：在分布式环境中，速率限制的精度容忍 5-10% 的误差。追求完美精度（如分布式锁）会引入不可接受的延迟。</p>\n<h2 id=\"公平调度-加权公平队列\">公平调度：加权公平队列</h2><p>当多个租户竞争同一资源池时，公平调度确保每个租户获得其 SLA 承诺的最低资源份额：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 请求入站&#10;        R1[租户 A 请求&lt;br/&gt;权重 = 10]&#10;        R2[租户 B 请求&lt;br/&gt;权重 = 5]&#10;        R3[租户 C 请求&lt;br/&gt;权重 = 1]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    R1 --&gt; WFQ[加权公平队列&lt;br/&gt;WFQ Scheduler]&#10;    R2 --&gt; WFQ&#10;    R3 --&gt; WFQ&#10;&#10;    WFQ --&gt; W1[Worker 池]&#10;&#10;    W1 --&gt; OUT1[租户 A: 获得 62.5% 处理能力]&#10;    W1 --&gt; OUT2[租户 B: 获得 31.25% 处理能力]&#10;    W1 --&gt; OUT3[租户 C: 获得 6.25% 处理能力]\">graph TD\n    subgraph 请求入站\n        R1[租户 A 请求&lt;br/&gt;权重 = 10]\n        R2[租户 B 请求&lt;br/&gt;权重 = 5]\n        R3[租户 C 请求&lt;br/&gt;权重 = 1]\n    end\n\n    R1 --&gt; WFQ[加权公平队列&lt;br/&gt;WFQ Scheduler]\n    R2 --&gt; WFQ\n    R3 --&gt; WFQ\n\n    WFQ --&gt; W1[Worker 池]\n\n    W1 --&gt; OUT1[租户 A: 获得 62.5% 处理能力]\n    W1 --&gt; OUT2[租户 B: 获得 31.25% 处理能力]\n    W1 --&gt; OUT3[租户 C: 获得 6.25% 处理能力]</pre><p>权重分配策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>付费等级越高，权重越大</li>\n<li>历史资源消耗越少（well-behaved），权重奖励越多</li>\n<li>当前请求积压越多，动态降低权重（防止饥饿其他租户）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"数据库层面的资源隔离\">数据库层面的资源隔离</h2><h3 id=\"postgresql-资源组-resource-groups\">PostgreSQL 资源组（Resource Groups）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 创建资源组：限制大租户的资源消耗&#10;CREATE RESOURCE GROUP tenant_standard WITH (&#10;  cpu_rate_limit = 20,         -- 最多使用 20% CPU&#10;  memory_limit = &#39;512MB&#39;       -- 最多使用 512MB 内存&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE RESOURCE GROUP tenant_enterprise WITH (&#10;  cpu_rate_limit = 50,&#10;  memory_limit = &#39;2GB&#39;&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 为连接角色分配资源组&#10;ALTER ROLE tenant_acme_user RESOURCE GROUP tenant_enterprise;&#10;ALTER ROLE tenant_small_user RESOURCE GROUP tenant_standard;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 创建资源组：限制大租户的资源消耗</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> RESOURCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GROUP tenant_standard </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cpu_rate_limit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,         </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 最多使用 20% CPU</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  memory_limit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '512MB'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       -- 最多使用 512MB 内存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> RESOURCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GROUP tenant_enterprise </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cpu_rate_limit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  memory_limit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2GB'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 为连接角色分配资源组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ALTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ROLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tenant_acme_user </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">RESOURCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GROUP tenant_enterprise;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ALTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ROLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tenant_small_user </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">RESOURCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GROUP tenant_standard;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"查询超时与熔断\">查询超时与熔断</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 租户级语句超时：防止长查询拖垮共享实例&#10;ALTER ROLE app_user SET statement_timeout = &#39;30s&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 对特定大租户放宽&#10;ALTER ROLE tenant_enterprise_user SET statement_timeout = &#39;120s&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 租户级语句超时：防止长查询拖垮共享实例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ALTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ROLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> app_user </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> statement_timeout </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '30s'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 对特定大租户放宽</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ALTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ROLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tenant_enterprise_user </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> statement_timeout </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '120s'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>应用层熔断器：当一个租户的错误率或延迟超过阈值时，临时降级其请求优先级或返回缓存数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"计量与计费集成\">计量与计费集成</h2><p>配额管理与计量计费紧密耦合——配额定义「限额」，计量记录「实际使用」，计费根据两者差值收费：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>精度要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实时计量</td>\n<td>记录每个请求/操作的资源消耗</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>聚合管道</td>\n<td>按租户+维度+时间窗口汇总</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配额检查</td>\n<td>实时判断是否超限</td>\n<td>毫秒级响应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用量报告</td>\n<td>生成账单周期内的用量明细</td>\n<td>日级准确</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计费触发</td>\n<td>超额用量按阶梯价格计费</td>\n<td>账单周期级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface UsageRecord {&#10;  tenantId: string;&#10;  metricName: string; // &#39;api_requests&#39; | &#39;storage_bytes&#39; | &#39;compute_seconds&#39;&#10;  value: number;&#10;  timestamp: Date;&#10;  metadata: Record&lt;string, string&gt;; // endpoint, region, etc.&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 计量数据流：高吞吐低延迟写入&#10;// 请求 → Kafka Topic → Flink 聚合 → TimescaleDB → 计费系统\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UsageRecord</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  tenantId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  metricName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 'api_requests' | 'storage_bytes' | 'compute_seconds'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  metadata</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// endpoint, region, etc.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 计量数据流：高吞吐低延迟写入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 请求 → Kafka Topic → Flink 聚合 → TimescaleDB → 计费系统</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"配额告警与自服务\">配额告警与自服务</h2><p>租户应能在超限前收到预警，并在管理控制台自助调整配额：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>告警阈值</th>\n<th>通知方式</th>\n<th>建议操作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>80%</td>\n<td>邮件 + 控制台警告</td>\n<td>提示升级套餐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>90%</td>\n<td>邮件 + Webhook + 控制台</td>\n<td>建议立即升级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>95%</td>\n<td>短信 + 所有渠道</td>\n<td>即将达到硬限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>请求被拒绝 + 控制台红色警告</td>\n<td>必须升级或等待配额重置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>资源配额与公平性保障是多租户 Pool/Bridge 模式的运营基础设施。核心实现包括：多维度配额体系（API 速率、并发、存储、带宽）、滑动窗口速率限制（Redis 集中状态）、加权公平队列调度、数据库层面的资源组和查询超时。配额管理必须与计量计费紧密耦合——配额定义限额，计量记录实际使用，计费根据超额收费。在分布式环境中速率限制容忍 5-10% 精度误差是可接受的工程取舍。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>相关文档：<a href=\"tenant-lifecycle-management\">租户生命周期管理</a> 覆盖了配额配置在 Provisioning 阶段的初始化流程；<a href=\"tenant-aware-observability\">租户感知可观测性</a> 展示如何监控配额使用趋势并提前预警。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"资源配额与公平性保障","id":"资源配额与公平性保障"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"吵闹邻居问题的本质","id":"吵闹邻居问题的本质"},{"level":2,"text":"配额模型设计","id":"配额模型设计"},{"level":3,"text":"多维度配额体系","id":"多维度配额体系"},{"level":3,"text":"配额继承与覆盖","id":"配额继承与覆盖"},{"level":2,"text":"速率限制实现","id":"速率限制实现"},{"level":3,"text":"令牌桶 + 滑动窗口混合方案","id":"令牌桶-滑动窗口混合方案"},{"level":3,"text":"分布式速率限制的一致性","id":"分布式速率限制的一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"公平调度：加权公平队列","id":"公平调度-加权公平队列"},{"level":2,"text":"数据库层面的资源隔离","id":"数据库层面的资源隔离"},{"level":3,"text":"PostgreSQL 资源组（Resource Groups）","id":"postgresql-资源组-resource-groups"},{"level":3,"text":"查询超时与熔断","id":"查询超时与熔断"},{"level":2,"text":"计量与计费集成","id":"计量与计费集成"},{"level":2,"text":"配额告警与自服务","id":"配额告警与自服务"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"租户生命周期管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/platform-engineering/tenant-lifecycle-management"},"next":{"title":"租户感知可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/platform-engineering/tenant-aware-observability"}}